          <p>Shower mixers fail after 8 to 10 years of daily use. The cartridge inside wears out and the shower stops working or runs cold. A new cartridge from £100 usually fixes it. We carry common cartridges on the van.</p>
          <a class="job-link" href="/shower-repair-liverpool"><span>Shower repair</span><span class="lc-arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Combi Boiler Wear</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Childwall's combi boilers were mostly fitted in the 1990s, 2000s and 2010s. They wear out at 12 to 15 years. Heat exchangers scale up. Diverter valves stick. We fix what we can. We replace what we can't.</p>
          <a class="job-link" href="/boiler-repair-liverpool"><span>Boiler repair</span><span class="lc-arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Burst Pipes in Cold Snaps</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>The 1930s lofts in Childwall aren't always well insulated. Cold weeks each winter cause pipe bursts above ceilings. We attend 24/7. We can lag the pipes on the same visit so it doesn't happen again next year.</p>
          <a class="job-link" href="/burst-pipe-repair-liverpool"><span>Burst pipe repair</span><span class="lc-arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Unvented Cylinder Faults</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>The bigger detached homes on Burns Close, Sulgrave Close and Chelwood Avenue run mains pressure cylinders. When the immersion or thermostat fails, the whole house loses hot water. We're G3 qualified. We carry common spares.</p>
